Recipe Detection: Phenomenon Signatures
Each meteorological phenomenon leaves a distinctive fingerprint in this 25D space. These are fuzzy detectors that add membership scores:
FOG DETECTOR (score 0.0-1.0):
  = min(
    membership(humidity_avg, sigmoid, center=88%, width=5%),      // must be humid
    membership(wind_speed_avg, reverse_sigmoid, center=8 km/h),   // low wind
    membership(dew_point_spread, reverse_sigmoid, center=2.5°C),  // near saturation
    membership(sunshine_fraction, reverse_sigmoid, center=0.3),   // overcast
    1.0  // always possible in autumn/winter, lower weight in summer
